 * @file v3-mfa.ino
 * @brief MFRC522 is implemented to bring MFA to the access control system.
 *        To access the pin screen, you are shown the scan screen where you must first scan your ID.
 *        All cards share the global pin for this version.
 * @date 2026-08-19
